# PC/AT 8x16 font of the VGA BIOS.
#
# The glyphs reproduce the original Tseng Labs ET4000 VGA BIOS typeface, see utils/LEGAL_FONT.md.
# The MIT-0 licence of utils/bios_at/LICENSE grants no rights in the typeface.
#
# ENCODING: the character code as a decimal number.
STARTFONT 2.1
FONT -Neetan-ATVgaFont-Medium-R-Normal--16-160-75-75-C-80-IBM-CP437
SIZE 16 75 75
FONTBOUNDINGBOX 8 16 0 0
STARTPROPERTIES 2
FONT_ASCENT 16
FONT_DESCENT 0
ENDPROPERTIES
